WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.057
Find the meter.

2
00:00:01.177 --> 00:00:03.545
Open Tools and choose Volatility.

3
00:00:03.665 --> 00:00:08.158
This gauge measures variability in generated SPY price changes.

4
00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:10.102
Read the guide.

5
00:00:10.222 --> 00:00:14.099
Expand How to use this tool and read what the percentage represents.

6
00:00:14.219 --> 00:00:16.983
A higher reading is not a buy or sell instruction.

7
00:00:18.003 --> 00:00:19.315
Apply the context.

8
00:00:19.435 --> 00:00:22.523
Return to Position size to consider your planned risk.

9
00:00:22.643 --> 00:00:27.275
Volatility is one input in a decision process, not a direction forecast.

